Agent: Apply when changing RTB auction, deals, or bid ingress on tracker.

Real-Time Bidding

In-process auction on `/track` and `POST /openrtb/bid` before `FilterEngine.Check`. Hot path: `.cursor/rules/hot-path.mdc`. Budget authority: `.cursor/rules/data-layer.mdc` Part I. Open work: `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`. Production runbook: `docs/RTB_PRODUCTION_RUNBOOK.md`.

`RunAuction` p99: < 15 us
Candidates scanned p99: < 500
Heap allocations: 0 per auction

Architecture

Two ingress paths share `RunAuction`:

1. **`/track`** — `processTrack()` → `applyRtbAuction` (`off` | `shadow` | `live`).
2. **`POST /openrtb/bid`** — `openrtb_exchange.go` → DFA parse → `RunAuction` → `WriteBidHTTPResponse` (fixed 129 B header + JSON in-place, 0 allocs).

Pre-auction gates (before `rankCandidates` scan budget): daypart bitmask + schedule bounds per candidate; frequency-cap snapshot lookup (fail-open when key missing). Rejects: `NoBidDaypartClosed`, `NoBidFreqCapExceeded`.

Package layout

Auction core: `internal/rtb/` — Registry, ranking, clearing, `BudgetStore`, snapshot
OpenRTB 2.6 codec: `internal/openrtb/` — wire types, decode, validate, encode, macros (no import of `ingestion`/`rtb`)
Tracker glue: `internal/ingestion/openrtb_exchange.go`, `openrtb_map.go`, `rtb_*.go`
Control plane: `internal/controlplane/adminapi/rtb_handlers.go`, `service_rtb.go`, `service_bid_floor.go`
Configuration: `internal/config/env_ingest.go` — `RTB_MODE`, exchange knobs, CH retention

Data flow

`Cold`: `SyncRtbCatalog`, `ReloadRtbDeals`, `UpdateCampaigns` — Rebuild geo shards, SoA buckets, targeting index, presort
`Hot`: `RunAuction` -> `rankCandidates` — Scan materialized SoA in O(window); CAS budget debit
`CH`: `rtb_deal_outcomes`, `rtb_exchange_log` — async ring-buffer writers on tracker when `CH_DSN` set

`Registry.catalog` is `atomic.Pointer[catalogSnapshot]` swapped on rebuild; readers never take writer locks.

Auction engine

Winner: `bid x CTR` effective score (`auction_ranking.go`); CTR in PPM; zero CTR -> 1.0
Tie-break: Higher `Weight`, then higher raw `Bid`
Early exit: `if score < maxScore { break }` after presort (bucket must be fully sorted)
Clearing: First- or second-price + reserve (`RTB_CLEARING_MODE=first`)
Geo: 64 shards via `req.GeoHash & 63`
Targeting: `RTB_TARGETING_INDEX=1` -> inverted index on geo/device/category
Budget: CAS in `CheckAndSpendAll`: campaign, customer pool, daily cap with rollback
Shadow: `RunAuctionEval` without spend (`RTB_MODE=shadow`)
Snapshot: `SaveSnapshot` / `LoadSnapshot` wire v4 at `RTB_SNAPSHOT_PATH`
Deals: `DealIndex` atomic swap; floors enforced on hot path

OpenRTB 2.6 exchange

Endpoint: `POST /openrtb/bid` on tracker (gnet handler)
Headers: `x-openrtb-version: 2.6`; no-bid per `RTB_EXCHANGE_NO_BID_MODE` (`204` or `nbr`)
QPS: `RTB_EXCHANGE_MAX_QPS` token bucket in `openrtb_exchange.go`
Metrics: `ad_rtb_exchange_request_total`, `ad_rtb_exchange_duration_seconds`, `ad_rtb_exchange_validate_errors_total`, `ad_rtb_exchange_throttle_total`
Reconcile: `GET /api/v1/rtb/reconcile/export?window=&request_id=` reads `rtb_exchange_log` in CH

Control plane (`/api/v1/rtb`)

validate-bid-request, integration-profile, shadow-diff, reconcile/export, deals CRUD
RBAC: `rtb:read`, `rtb:write`
Outbox: `RELOAD_RTB_CATALOG` -> Redis pubsub

